OL,3,GNEWSAHow to embrace your inner
OL,4,AMiddle-earth for UK's first hobbits
OL,5,Afestival
OL,6,
OL,7,FWant to dress like a hobbit? Then you
OL,8,Fought to be thinking waistcoats,
OL,9,Fwalking sticks and dresses - but you
OL,10,Fmight draw the line at going barefoot.
OL,12,FHundreds of people will be dressing
OL,13,Flike the Middle-earth characters as
OL,14,Fthey attend the UK's first hobbit
OL,15,Ffestival
OL,17,FThe five-day Brandywine Festival, at
OL,18,FWeston Park on the
OL,19,FShropshire-Staffordshire border,
OL,20,Finvites its guests to dress up and act
OL,21,Flike the little folk throughout.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
